(5159039, 750409, 60173, '<td valign="top">I was really hoping to see a fog photo. I meant to get up early and get a shot of my own, but it''s so hard to get out of a warm bed in the wee winter hours! I admire your motivation, heh.<br/> <br/>The mood you created with your processing compliments the subject matter. Very pleasant.</td>', 'I was really hoping to see a fog photo. I meant to get up early and get a shot of my own, but it''s so hard to get out of a warm bed in the wee winter hours! I admire your motivation, heh. The mood you created with your processing compliments the subject matter. Very pleasant.', '2008-12-31 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
