(5159103, 751590, 60173, '<td valign="top">I want to take this as a serious artistic photo, but I can''t. That cute little squished face cracks me up! And the stretched out cone-head in the stem of the glass, oh my, heh.</td>', 'I want to take this as a serious artistic photo, but I can''t. That cute little squished face cracks me up! And the stretched out cone-head in the stem of the glass, oh my, heh.', '2008-12-31 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
