(5159127, 750508, 60173, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a gorgeous little girl. She has an incredibly powerful classic look to her. Those eyes are captivating.<br/> <br/>At first I thought the image didn''t do her any justice, but maybe it does. Maybe that''s partially why she''s so striking. I simply don''t know what to think.</td>', 'Wow, what a gorgeous little girl. She has an incredibly powerful classic look to her. Those eyes are captivating. At first I thought the image didn''t do her any justice, but maybe it does. Maybe that''s partially why she''s so striking. I simply don''t know what to think.', '2008-12-31 01:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
