(5163603, 750637, 83313, '<td valign="top">All that keeps this from being really an awesome shot is the presence of a lot of grainy high ISO. Out of curiosity, I popped this into my image editor and ran some noise removal, a touch a contrast enhancement and sharpening. The smoothness of the colors, and interesting lighting of this image really came out. It responded very well to a modest amount of noise reduction.</td>', 'All that keeps this from being really an awesome shot is the presence of a lot of grainy high ISO. Out of curiosity, I popped this into my image editor and ran some noise removal, a touch a contrast enhancement and sharpening. The smoothness of the colors, and interesting lighting of this image really came out. It responded very well to a modest amount of noise reduction.', '2009-01-01 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
