(5163910, 751547, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for moths. And you''ve framed him perfectly. This is simple but mysterious. It has that sublime feeling of being carefully planned yet insane at the same time. The textures and tones are gorgeous and outrageous. I only wish my soul had such a home.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''m a sucker for moths. And you''ve framed him perfectly. This is simple but mysterious. It has that sublime feeling of being carefully planned yet insane at the same time. The textures and tones are gorgeous and outrageous. I only wish my soul had such a home. Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-01-01 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
