(5163919, 750097, 50695, '<td valign="top">Now you''re talking. The fish are perfectly clear and the lady is distorted (but not dim!). This is a nicely balanced photo and the darkness serves you by eliminating distractions and making the water seemingly endless. <br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Now you''re talking. The fish are perfectly clear and the lady is distorted (but not dim!). This is a nicely balanced photo and the darkness serves you by eliminating distractions and making the water seemingly endless.  Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-01-01 19:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
