(5164020, 749930, 102200, '<td valign="top">would be better in a setting</td>', 'would be better in a setting', '2009-01-01 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164202, 750094, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is really a beautiful picture.  I''m not sure it shows transparency.  The creek is reflective.  Maybe the fog, but it turns opaque very fast.  6 based on the nice picture and border.  Higher if I felt it met the challenge.</td>', 'This is really a beautiful picture.  I''m not sure it shows transparency.  The creek is reflective.  Maybe the fog, but it turns opaque very fast.  6 based on the nice picture and border.  Higher if I felt it met the challenge.', '2009-01-01 22:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164205, 750980, 76430, '<td valign="top">I hope that is ice.  If it''s glass it''s really thick and sharp!  Nice timing and stop motion.</td>', 'I hope that is ice.  If it''s glass it''s really thick and sharp!  Nice timing and stop motion.', '2009-01-01 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164213, 750138, 76430, '<td valign="top">LOL good rules explanation in title.  I was so concerned about that rule on a current challenge I included multiple artworks (not paintings) to ensure I didn''t violate a rule.  Now I wish I could figure out what yours is and how it relates to transparency.  It looks like a cut-out cardboard in a picture frame.</td>', 'LOL good rules explanation in title.  I was so concerned about that rule on a current challenge I included multiple artworks (not paintings) to ensure I didn''t violate a rule.  Now I wish I could figure out what yours is and how it relates to transparency.  It looks like a cut-out cardboard in a picture frame.', '2009-01-01 22:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164216, 751149, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture that meets the challenge very well.  Now I wish I had gone to our local tidepools to shoot for this. Can''t wait to see where this was shot.  I wish you had more width in it.  7</td>', 'Beautiful picture that meets the challenge very well.  Now I wish I had gone to our local tidepools to shoot for this. Can''t wait to see where this was shot.  I wish you had more width in it.  7', '2009-01-01 22:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164354, 750111, 76430, '<td valign="top">Unique interpretation of the challenge.  I never thought of flames as transparent but sure enough they are.  The man in the back looks like a painting and also like he''s on fire.  I wish you had posed him better.  I think it''s the gloved hand on the swing side that bothers me. 7</td>', 'Unique interpretation of the challenge.  I never thought of flames as transparent but sure enough they are.  The man in the back looks like a painting and also like he''s on fire.  I wish you had posed him better.  I think it''s the gloved hand on the swing side that bothers me. 7', '2009-01-02 00:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164361, 751079, 76430, '<td valign="top">...and shame on me!  Nicely composed and very fitting frame.  What is under her right thumb?</td>', '...and shame on me!  Nicely composed and very fitting frame.  What is under her right thumb?', '2009-01-02 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164368, 751592, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and star filter effect.  I''m missing Christmas already.</td>', 'Nice DOF and star filter effect.  I''m missing Christmas already.', '2009-01-02 00:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164453, 751590, 76430, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 but coming back and looking at it more I''m bumping to a 7.  I won''t fault you for the imperfect glass surface, but I like the different proportion face image in the glass vs the stem, the black glove and the transparent ring on the finger.</td>', 'I gave you a 6 but coming back and looking at it more I''m bumping to a 7.  I won''t fault you for the imperfect glass surface, but I like the different proportion face image in the glass vs the stem, the black glove and the transparent ring on the finger.', '2009-01-02 01:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164462, 751577, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like this simulated transparency.</td>', 'I like this simulated transparency.', '2009-01-02 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164464, 751088, 76430, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a couple of Saran wrapped nude females in this challenge.  It looks like this is the closest it gets.  This would stand out as a nice photo on its own without the wrap, and of course it only works with the wrap due to the challenge.  I''m thinking how silly it would look without the challenge context.  Good meeting of challenge and title.</td>', 'I expected to see a couple of Saran wrapped nude females in this challenge.  It looks like this is the closest it gets.  This would stand out as a nice photo on its own without the wrap, and of course it only works with the wrap due to the challenge.  I''m thinking how silly it would look without the challenge context.  Good meeting of challenge and title.', '2009-01-02 01:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164470, 750964, 76430, '<td valign="top">Really nice but scary perspective.  I hope the transparency is the glass between you and the alligator/crocodile for you safety, and because the water isn''t at all transparent, so I''ll vote with that assumption.  If you used a CPF it would have helped make the water transparent.  Overall I think it''s got too much of a green tint to it.</td>', 'Really nice but scary perspective.  I hope the transparency is the glass between you and the alligator/crocodile for you safety, and because the water isn''t at all transparent, so I''ll vote with that assumption.  If you used a CPF it would have helped make the water transparent.  Overall I think it''s got too much of a green tint to it.', '2009-01-02 01:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164489, 750490, 76430, '<td valign="top">Lovely glass ball photo.  It looks like a wonderful tropical island, which I''m a real softy for 8.</td>', 'Lovely glass ball photo.  It looks like a wonderful tropical island, which I''m a real softy for 8.', '2009-01-02 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164503, 750376, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you added title because you can''t see the water.  Of course this is a tidepool image for those that recognize it.</td>', 'I''m glad you added title because you can''t see the water.  Of course this is a tidepool image for those that recognize it.', '2009-01-02 02:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164505, 751155, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is a common technique, but you did it well and I appreciate the work involved in doing this well after my only aborted attempt to do this with water.  Did you use glycerine, which I think is supposed to be better to work with?  It may have been better with the real paper more out of focus.</td>', 'This is a common technique, but you did it well and I appreciate the work involved in doing this well after my only aborted attempt to do this with water.  Did you use glycerine, which I think is supposed to be better to work with?  It may have been better with the real paper more out of focus.', '2009-01-02 02:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164517, 750097, 76430, '<td valign="top">I just saw one almost like this the past day with the woman at the bottom of the frame, but I can''t find it now.  Was that you also?  Nice shot, though it looks like something from CSI.  How were you able to get permission for the model to swim in a Koi pond, let alone have her go along with it?  Is this a personal pond?</td>', 'I just saw one almost like this the past day with the woman at the bottom of the frame, but I can''t find it now.  Was that you also?  Nice shot, though it looks like something from CSI.  How were you able to get permission for the model to swim in a Koi pond, let alone have her go along with it?  Is this a personal pond?', '2009-01-02 02:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164520, 750664, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good capture, though I''d like to see it with an adjusted CPF to get some of the surface reflection out of it.  Is this a trout hatchery or farm or is it in the wild, where getting three grown trout together would be improbable?</td>', 'Good capture, though I''d like to see it with an adjusted CPF to get some of the surface reflection out of it.  Is this a trout hatchery or farm or is it in the wild, where getting three grown trout together would be improbable?', '2009-01-02 02:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164525, 750606, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but I''m trying to figure out how it meets the challenge.  Is it some other usage of transparency?</td>', 'I love this shot, but I''m trying to figure out how it meets the challenge.  Is it some other usage of transparency?', '2009-01-02 02:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164532, 750775, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very interesting transparent can. Is it a reflection or was it pulled away during a time exposure?</td>', 'Very interesting transparent can. Is it a reflection or was it pulled away during a time exposure?', '2009-01-02 02:51:10.000000', NULL, 1);
