(5169367, 751153, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very absorbing, provocative photograph.  It asks questions of the viewer; about context, even about the medium we are seeing (i.e. Is it under water?  In a puddle?  In a deep drift at the base of the tree?)  Then other thoughts follow (What does it smell like?  Is it soft, or crunchy?)  I like questions, and the less information that''s easily grasped, the more questions your image asks.  Too good for a score but I''m giving it one anyway.  9.</td>', 'Very absorbing, provocative photograph.  It asks questions of the viewer; about context, even about the medium we are seeing (i.e. Is it under water?  In a puddle?  In a deep drift at the base of the tree?)  Then other thoughts follow (What does it smell like?  Is it soft, or crunchy?)  I like questions, and the less information that''s easily grasped, the more questions your image asks.  Too good for a score but I''m giving it one anyway.  9.', '2009-01-04 01:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169370, 750898, 30364, '<td valign="top">Facing the sun and dreaming of (yearning for) ... another place, maybe?  Lovely pale lemon tones, and of course gorgeous light.</td>', 'Facing the sun and dreaming of (yearning for) ... another place, maybe?  Lovely pale lemon tones, and of course gorgeous light.', '2009-01-04 01:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5169788, 751605, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The colors and shapes of light make for an interesting abstract.</td>', 'I like it.  The colors and shapes of light make for an interesting abstract.', '2009-01-04 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
