(5170066, 750606, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m dense, or not seeing a creative interpretation of the topic, but I don''t see the use of transparency here.  If it was shot through glass it''s not showing. (Maybe the slight milkiness in the corner is the edge of a salad bowl?) The humor here is going over my head as well. I don''t get the pun either, and I''m someone who does a lot of misunderstood humorous entries. Sorry. I''ll be very interested in seeing your details after the challenge to find out what I missed.</td>', 'Maybe I''m dense, or not seeing a creative interpretation of the topic, but I don''t see the use of transparency here.  If it was shot through glass it''s not showing. (Maybe the slight milkiness in the corner is the edge of a salad bowl?) The humor here is going over my head as well. I don''t get the pun either, and I''m someone who does a lot of misunderstood humorous entries. Sorry. I''ll be very interested in seeing your details after the challenge to find out what I missed.', '2009-01-04 13:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
