(5170300, 750937, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the reflections in the glass as they''re quite distracting.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the reflections in the glass as they''re quite distracting.', '2009-01-04 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5170306, 751560, 100495, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.', '2009-01-04 15:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5170310, 751293, 100495, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The hands add a lot and could be more of a feature.<br/> <br/>Omly minor point is the photog''s reflection in the glass which is a little distracting.</td>', 'Excellent.  The hands add a lot and could be more of a feature. Omly minor point is the photog''s reflection in the glass which is a little distracting.', '2009-01-04 15:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171018, 751144, 29180, '<td valign="top">Nice image, not sure if I understand the transparency though...</td>', 'Nice image, not sure if I understand the transparency though...', '2009-01-04 20:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171118, 751121, 71244, '<td valign="top">Is this a collie or a sheltie? Love collies, my grandma used to breed them. Nice image, pretty dog!</td>', 'Is this a collie or a sheltie? Love collies, my grandma used to breed them. Nice image, pretty dog!', '2009-01-04 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171121, 751296, 71244, '<td valign="top">i love the look on orange kitty''s face. nice capture and composition!</td>', 'i love the look on orange kitty''s face. nice capture and composition!', '2009-01-04 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171133, 751547, 71244, '<td valign="top">beautiful. a fav and a 10.</td>', 'beautiful. a fav and a 10.', '2009-01-04 21:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171159, 751433, 29180, '<td valign="top">I like it, clean and simple</td>', 'I like it, clean and simple', '2009-01-04 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171377, 750508, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly captivating image. The lighting and subject framed by the red is just awesome. I love the natural look without tons of processing, my favorite so far.</td>', 'This is an incredibly captivating image. The lighting and subject framed by the red is just awesome. I love the natural look without tons of processing, my favorite so far.', '2009-01-04 23:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171381, 750826, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and nice light tones</td>', 'Very well composed and nice light tones', '2009-01-04 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171384, 751458, 70000, '<td valign="top">Lovely and sombre</td>', 'Lovely and sombre', '2009-01-04 23:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171385, 751350, 70000, '<td valign="top">lovely, the area on the right hand side is a little distracting because it is not consistent with the tones of the water over the face, but this is very well lit and a lovely image</td>', 'lovely, the area on the right hand side is a little distracting because it is not consistent with the tones of the water over the face, but this is very well lit and a lovely image', '2009-01-04 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171816, 751490, 76430, '<td valign="top">Well, you confused me.  I''m sitting here trying to figure out the meaning of it and if it really shows transparency.  I guess the refraction at the bottom of the glass is transparancy.  What is in the glass?  The M&amp;M''s, or whatever they are, aren''t in focus and it would be better to be sharp.  The apple is fine out of focus.</td>', 'Well, you confused me.  I''m sitting here trying to figure out the meaning of it and if it really shows transparency.  I guess the refraction at the bottom of the glass is transparancy.  What is in the glass?  The M&M''s, or whatever they are, aren''t in focus and it would be better to be sharp.  The apple is fine out of focus.', '2009-01-05 01:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171819, 750462, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl posed and lighted nicely and nice meeting of challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful girl posed and lighted nicely and nice meeting of challenge.', '2009-01-05 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171834, 751144, 76430, '<td valign="top">While trying to figure out where the transparency was I figured out the title means evening or dusk.  It''s a little small at 600 pixels.  It''s a pretty scene and the exposure is pretty good for the conditions and basic editing.  With Advanced editing you could have done bracketed exposures and tone mapping.  Your Alpha 200 (exif data) will give you a good picture, so larger with some sharpening in post processing may have made this more detailed.  Are the tree leaves the transparency?</td>', 'While trying to figure out where the transparency was I figured out the title means evening or dusk.  It''s a little small at 600 pixels.  It''s a pretty scene and the exposure is pretty good for the conditions and basic editing.  With Advanced editing you could have done bracketed exposures and tone mapping.  Your Alpha 200 (exif data) will give you a good picture, so larger with some sharpening in post processing may have made this more detailed.  Are the tree leaves the transparency?', '2009-01-05 01:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171839, 750645, 76430, '<td valign="top">This would normally get a low score for the photographer reflection, but since it''s the purpose of this shot you did well.  Good take on the challenge with a unique twist.</td>', 'This would normally get a low score for the photographer reflection, but since it''s the purpose of this shot you did well.  Good take on the challenge with a unique twist.', '2009-01-05 01:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5171862, 751384, 100495, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo although I don''t think it strictly meets the challenge.  doesn''t bother me though - 7.</td>', 'A beautiful photo although I don''t think it strictly meets the challenge.  doesn''t bother me though - 7.', '2009-01-05 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5172007, 751547, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, sophisticated photograph.  It is many-textured, both literally and figuratively, and so there''s a fresh reward for every additional minute spent looking at it.  I''m up to <strike>about 12</strike> nearly 15 minutes in total with it so far, and it hasn''t run out of gas yet.  So I must award it the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a beautiful, sophisticated photograph.  It is many-textured, both literally and figuratively, and so there''s a fresh reward for every additional minute spent looking at it.  I''m up to about 12 nearly 15 minutes in total with it so far, and it hasn''t run out of gas yet.  So I must award it the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-01-05 03:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
