(5173806, 750111, 99497, '<td valign="top">What a creative and unique shot. Focussing on the fire rather than the man behind add a lot of mood to the shot. A perfect 10. My choice for blue. Only nit would be the white object/bottle  at the left side of the photo which distracts a bit.</td>', 'What a creative and unique shot. Focussing on the fire rather than the man behind add a lot of mood to the shot. A perfect 10. My choice for blue. Only nit would be the white object/bottle  at the left side of the photo which distracts a bit.', '2009-01-05 22:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174003, 750602, 96915, '<td valign="top">I love this game!  Great colors and perspective.</td>', 'I love this game!  Great colors and perspective.', '2009-01-05 23:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174044, 750968, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Controversy about the artwork rule aside, I like this idea, but this Challenge (my interpretation anyway) being all about transparency, I''d like to have seen you ''use'' the transparency through the liquids (or even the glass) more than you have - whether via a different angle, etc., e.g.: the effect coming through the middle glass with the wagon wheel looks good, but it is such a small part of the image.</td>', '2 - Controversy about the artwork rule aside, I like this idea, but this Challenge (my interpretation anyway) being all about transparency, I''d like to have seen you ''use'' the transparency through the liquids (or even the glass) more than you have - whether via a different angle, etc., e.g.: the effect coming through the middle glass with the wagon wheel looks good, but it is such a small part of the image.', '2009-01-06 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174050, 750606, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - So much effort for no transparency.</td>', '1 - So much effort for no transparency.', '2009-01-06 00:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174053, 751092, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice idea, including how you''ve stored your watch.  Like to have seen the transparency in the dome ''used'' a little more, ''somehow'' - maybe with the image behind or just distortion of the watch via angle, who knows - but your image, your call.</td>', '5 - Nice idea, including how you''ve stored your watch.  Like to have seen the transparency in the dome ''used'' a little more, ''somehow'' - maybe with the image behind or just distortion of the watch via angle, who knows - but your image, your call.', '2009-01-06 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174055, 751088, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - I get it but I think your execution is lacking - it is not enhancing the image or subject via a good effect, etc.</td>', '3 - I get it but I think your execution is lacking - it is not enhancing the image or subject via a good effect, etc.', '2009-01-06 00:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174057, 751441, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice image (although I miss the texture) - be nice to see the wing(s) in focus, given the Challenge.</td>', '4 - Nice image (although I miss the texture) - be nice to see the wing(s) in focus, given the Challenge.', '2009-01-06 00:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174059, 751560, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - That left edge of the white with the water is very ethereal - like the slightly different take on transparency caused by the oof ''fore bokeh''.</td>', '6 - That left edge of the white with the water is very ethereal - like the slightly different take on transparency caused by the oof ''fore bokeh''.', '2009-01-06 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174063, 751446, 76430, '<td valign="top">I think you could have done much better on the lighting, and I''m not sure what the rod and other  clear objects are for, but I like the transparent figure in the sink a lot along with the skewed composition.</td>', 'I think you could have done much better on the lighting, and I''m not sure what the rod and other  clear objects are for, but I like the transparent figure in the sink a lot along with the skewed composition.', '2009-01-06 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174065, 750344, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is that a picture on the mug?  It''s pretty cool.  I like the blue liquid also.  Good exposure.</td>', 'Is that a picture on the mug?  It''s pretty cool.  I like the blue liquid also.  Good exposure.', '2009-01-06 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174067, 751608, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very common technique, but well done, and if this is really a pin it''s a great macro.</td>', 'Very common technique, but well done, and if this is really a pin it''s a great macro.', '2009-01-06 00:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174073, 751332, 76430, '<td valign="top">You''re only going about 17 MPH or KPH, but that must be some bumpy road!  Very interesting effect and good job keeping the motion still in the car other than a little hand movement.  Great title.</td>', 'You''re only going about 17 MPH or KPH, but that must be some bumpy road!  Very interesting effect and good job keeping the motion still in the car other than a little hand movement.  Great title.', '2009-01-06 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174076, 750979, 76430, '<td valign="top">This would be much better with better lighting.  This is a perfect set-up for a light tent.</td>', 'This would be much better with better lighting.  This is a perfect set-up for a light tent.', '2009-01-06 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174080, 750968, 76430, '<td valign="top">I thought it was real for a second.  Great background picture.  Nice setup of glasses, and I really like the little basket.</td>', 'I thought it was real for a second.  Great background picture.  Nice setup of glasses, and I really like the little basket.', '2009-01-06 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174088, 750344, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this, wonder about straightening and/or crop/framing variation.</td>', '6 - Like this, wonder about straightening and/or crop/framing variation.', '2009-01-06 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174090, 751577, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and this came up for me right after the Baby Monitor with a similar effect.  I''m wondering how this would work with the patch stuck on eyeglasses to cover up the edges and slip the hand, or at least fingers, under the right lens.</td>', 'Very creative, and this came up for me right after the Baby Monitor with a similar effect.  I''m wondering how this would work with the patch stuck on eyeglasses to cover up the edges and slip the hand, or at least fingers, under the right lens.', '2009-01-06 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5174091, 750194, 76430, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate such a long explanatory title is needed, but I guess it is to get the whole intent.  I love how the green and red paint over the face.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate such a long explanatory title is needed, but I guess it is to get the whole intent.  I love how the green and red paint over the face.', '2009-01-06 00:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
