(5174680, 750344, 58247, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for best of this challenge. It is well thought out and well executed. My only nit pick is the fact that you can see the reflection of the diver in the top of the pitcher. But since you couldn''t cone it out, I''ll let it slide. Bravo! Hope to see this on the front page. :-)</td>', 'This is my pick for best of this challenge. It is well thought out and well executed. My only nit pick is the fact that you can see the reflection of the diver in the top of the pitcher. But since you couldn''t cone it out, I''ll let it slide. Bravo! Hope to see this on the front page. :-)', '2009-01-06 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
