(5175167, 750344, 101590, '<td valign="top">I like this, but how did you do it? (just saw that i was not the only one to question, am looking forward to finding out)</td>', 'I like this, but how did you do it? (just saw that i was not the only one to question, am looking forward to finding out)', '2009-01-06 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175252, 751474, 102386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The reflection whithin each drop makes this special.</td>', 'Beautiful. The reflection whithin each drop makes this special.', '2009-01-06 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175266, 751505, 83313, '<td valign="top">A unique way of meeting the challenge. The shot itself is not really appealing to me, but it''s not bad either. Perhaps the composition is just lacking something to lead my eye around. It''s just static in the middle of the frame. I''m not sure what to suggest, however.</td>', 'A unique way of meeting the challenge. The shot itself is not really appealing to me, but it''s not bad either. Perhaps the composition is just lacking something to lead my eye around. It''s just static in the middle of the frame. I''m not sure what to suggest, however.', '2009-01-06 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175268, 751330, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how you did this treatment under basic rules. Looks like a sepia overlay, but it could just be a partial desaturation. Nice example of street photography.</td>', 'I''d like to know how you did this treatment under basic rules. Looks like a sepia overlay, but it could just be a partial desaturation. Nice example of street photography.', '2009-01-06 17:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175273, 751577, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice try. I wonder if you could have used some makeup (or something) to blend the paper to the hand for a more convincing illusion. If you had succeeded in creating the illusion of transparency, I think I would have given this a very high vote. As it is, It still gets a 6 from me for the idea and overall good photography.</td>', 'Nice try. I wonder if you could have used some makeup (or something) to blend the paper to the hand for a more convincing illusion. If you had succeeded in creating the illusion of transparency, I think I would have given this a very high vote. As it is, It still gets a 6 from me for the idea and overall good photography.', '2009-01-06 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175278, 751383, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be interested in finding out what this is. Bottom of a drinking glass? I do like abstracts, but I am afraid this one does not really appeal to me. I do recognize an effort to try and get something unique, however.</td>', 'I''ll be interested in finding out what this is. Bottom of a drinking glass? I do like abstracts, but I am afraid this one does not really appeal to me. I do recognize an effort to try and get something unique, however.', '2009-01-06 17:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175281, 750462, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can see why it had to be validated. Looks like an overlay. Good work.</td>', 'I can see why it had to be validated. Looks like an overlay. Good work.', '2009-01-06 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175284, 751293, 42181, '<td valign="top">Shame you started off with such a ropey model ;-)</td>', 'Shame you started off with such a ropey model ;-)', '2009-01-06 17:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175290, 750111, 83313, '<td valign="top">Though he never won a challenge, Frank did achieve a measure of personal satisfaction when he burned all his brown ribbons.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-07 11:54:07.</i></td>', 'Though he never won a challenge, Frank did achieve a measure of personal satisfaction when he burned all his brown ribbons.', '2009-01-06 17:34:36.000000', '2009-01-07 11:54:07.000000', 1),
(5175291, 751155, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with water drops.</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with water drops.', '2009-01-06 17:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175348, 750097, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love this image - it must be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70000" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lovethelight</a>; I think this is a much better image than the Asia entry so I''m sure you''ll ribbon - 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this image - it must be  lovethelight; I think this is a much better image than the Asia entry so I''m sure you''ll ribbon - 10 from me.', '2009-01-06 18:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175361, 750261, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Whilst I''ve no doubt whatsoever that this meets the challenge, I would say that there''s only limited visual representation of it in what we see and it''s more a case of slight blurriness in the chin area than anything obvious. But lovely sharpness of detail and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Whilst I''ve no doubt whatsoever that this meets the challenge, I would say that there''s only limited visual representation of it in what we see and it''s more a case of slight blurriness in the chin area than anything obvious. But lovely sharpness of detail and composition.', '2009-01-06 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175363, 751526, 3087, '<td valign="top">Heh, love that textured glass. I like the effect the glass has on the shape and colours behind.</td>', 'Heh, love that textured glass. I like the effect the glass has on the shape and colours behind.', '2009-01-06 18:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175366, 750826, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it actually took me a little while to realise that the shadow towards the top is an inkwell, the small circle at the feather tip a spilled drop of ink and that the message is half-written. I like the idea though.</td>', 'I like the idea but it actually took me a little while to realise that the shadow towards the top is an inkwell, the small circle at the feather tip a spilled drop of ink and that the message is half-written. I like the idea though.', '2009-01-06 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175370, 751293, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a fun idea! I think it would work better if the clear plastic on which the graffiti eyepatch, beard and stitches are drawn were the full width of the frame so that one couldn''t see those two edges. Also, positioning so the stitches were more accurately over skin would be good too. BUT it''s such a fun idea, I like it!</td>', 'This is a fun idea! I think it would work better if the clear plastic on which the graffiti eyepatch, beard and stitches are drawn were the full width of the frame so that one couldn''t see those two edges. Also, positioning so the stitches were more accurately over skin would be good too. BUT it''s such a fun idea, I like it!', '2009-01-06 18:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5175375, 750097, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, is she really in the fishpond? Kudos to her, you wouldn''t catch me in there with all that floating fish poo! ;) Like this one a lot, it''s quirky, interesting composition, great high contrast black and white...</td>', 'Wow, is she really in the fishpond? Kudos to her, you wouldn''t catch me in there with all that floating fish poo! ;) Like this one a lot, it''s quirky, interesting composition, great high contrast black and white...', '2009-01-06 18:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
