(5176514, 751593, 89723, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddhead:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow! Did you cut out the screen on your laptop? No? THEN IT ISN''T TRANSPARENT! There is no hole on the laptop! I don''t care how powerful your backlights are. You get a 10! Minus 9! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There is a pane of glass in front of the child and monitor. I guess it''s too clean. I''ll try harder in the future.</td>', 'Originally posted by toddhead: Wow! Did you cut out the screen on your laptop? No? THEN IT ISN''T TRANSPARENT! There is no hole on the laptop! I don''t care how powerful your backlights are. You get a 10! Minus 9!   There is a pane of glass in front of the child and monitor. I guess it''s too clean. I''ll try harder in the future.', '2009-01-07 00:45:38.000000', NULL, 0),
