(5176855, 750194, 30982, '<td valign="top">Try not to worry too much about scores - I know that''s hard in a place where we compete.  This is an excellent shot - really meets the challenge well and is enjoyable to view.  Some may find it too complex or busy, but to me that adds a story.  I really like the way the colors and text are imposed on the person''s head and hands.  Well seen!</td>', 'Try not to worry too much about scores - I know that''s hard in a place where we compete.  This is an excellent shot - really meets the challenge well and is enjoyable to view.  Some may find it too complex or busy, but to me that adds a story.  I really like the way the colors and text are imposed on the person''s head and hands.  Well seen!', '2009-01-07 04:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
