(5177103, 751384, 43774, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AlexSaberi:</b></div><hr/><i> amazing shot. cant believe the amount of scores below 5. jealousy!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Jealousy? Actually if you read the challenge description, this does not meet the challenge:<br/> <br/>Create a photo in which a transparent or semi-transparent object is <i><b>between</b></i> you and your <b><i>subject</i></b>. <br/> <br/>So while I do think this is a beautiful photo, those low scores are justified and have nothing to do with jealousy.<br/> <br/>Sorry, Irene, for ranting on your photo. Congrats on the blue, it''s a wonderful photo.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by AlexSaberi: amazing shot. cant believe the amount of scores below 5. jealousy!!   Jealousy? Actually if you read the challenge description, this does not meet the challenge: Create a photo in which a transparent or semi-transparent object is between you and your subject.  So while I do think this is a beautiful photo, those low scores are justified and have nothing to do with jealousy. Sorry, Irene, for ranting on your photo. Congrats on the blue, it''s a wonderful photo.', '2009-01-07 06:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
