(5177303, 751462, 79816, '<td valign="top">Wow - I gave this one my highest vote for the challenge. Rather disappointing to see it end so low!<br/>I really liked the symbolism of the blurry distorted shot to highlight the dream like state a good book can take us too. Well done, and thanks for sharing. Far more interesting shot than another sharply focused picture of water....<br/> <br/>On the negative side, a little more thought to the models pose, and perhaps the half picture sticking out of his head is a little distracting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-07 08:27:11.</i></td>', 'Wow - I gave this one my highest vote for the challenge. Rather disappointing to see it end so low!I really liked the symbolism of the blurry distorted shot to highlight the dream like state a good book can take us too. Well done, and thanks for sharing. Far more interesting shot than another sharply focused picture of water.... On the negative side, a little more thought to the models pose, and perhaps the half picture sticking out of his head is a little distracting.', '2009-01-07 08:26:36.000000', '2009-01-07 08:27:11.000000', 0),
