(5177766, 751384, 97893, '<td valign="top">What do you plan to do Irene - Build a house of ''Blues''?!<br/> <br/>:-), Congratulations on a shot that is fabulously done!<br/> <br/>-Vikram<br/> <br/>P.S. As I have mentioned earlier:  Your approach to photography is inspiring for me. :-).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-07 11:22:03.</i></td>', 'What do you plan to do Irene - Build a house of ''Blues''?! :-), Congratulations on a shot that is fabulously done! -Vikram P.S. As I have mentioned earlier:  Your approach to photography is inspiring for me. :-).', '2009-01-07 11:15:50.000000', '2009-01-07 11:22:03.000000', 0),
