(5177815, 751583, 68947, '<td valign="top">I thought this one was really interesting!  Actually, I thought it was part of a fish tank, taken through the glass and water with reflections off the back glass of the tank!  You fooled me and I really liked it!<br/> <br/>Keep experimenting like this because it''s really interesting and very creative! :)  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I thought this one was really interesting!  Actually, I thought it was part of a fish tank, taken through the glass and water with reflections off the back glass of the tank!  You fooled me and I really liked it! Keep experimenting like this because it''s really interesting and very creative! :)   ', '2009-01-07 11:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
