(5177938, 751384, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great shot Irene. Its funny but with all the water shots you do, you still find interesting and unique approaches to shooting them.  In this shot, I like how the bottle has an almost metallic appearance while still retaining its transparency.</td>', 'Great shot Irene. Its funny but with all the water shots you do, you still find interesting and unique approaches to shooting them.  In this shot, I like how the bottle has an almost metallic appearance while still retaining its transparency.', '2009-01-07 12:37:52.000000', NULL, 0),
