(5177976, 750006, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent - love it.</td>', 'Excellent - love it.', '2009-01-07 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177990, 750989, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiterook:</b></div><hr/><i> What is wrong with this beautiful image?  This should be in the top ten! Nice captured of the trees. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m sure it''s in your Top 10. <br/> <br/>Nice try, Bear. I didn''t fare much better in this one...</td>', 'Originally posted by whiterook: What is wrong with this beautiful image?  This should be in the top ten! Nice captured of the trees.   I''m sure it''s in your Top 10.  Nice try, Bear. I didn''t fare much better in this one...', '2009-01-07 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
