(5180926, 751591, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. ( How could this not meet the challenge??? ) I love the crispness of the images against the totally blurred out bg. And I agree with<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=92577" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hesitant</a> that the drops on the right look like glasses.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. ( How could this not meet the challenge??? ) I love the crispness of the images against the totally blurred out bg. And I agree with hesitant that the drops on the right look like glasses.', '2009-01-08 17:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
