(5183008, 751287, 23251, '<td valign="top">Hi Pineapple<br/> <br/>Yeah everything in our 8'' tank is real some of the wood (hollow tree root) is 4''-5'' long.  We love it and the Angles, Brazillian Rams and Bristlenose (pleco) are all breeding like crazy lol.<br/> <br/>Oh btw the Ram is actually a Red / Blue tetra, lovely fish.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-10 03:35:42.</i></td>', 'Hi Pineapple Yeah everything in our 8'' tank is real some of the wood (hollow tree root) is 4''-5'' long.  We love it and the Angles, Brazillian Rams and Bristlenose (pleco) are all breeding like crazy lol. Oh btw the Ram is actually a Red / Blue tetra, lovely fish.', '2009-01-10 03:34:04.000000', '2009-01-10 03:35:42.000000', 0),
